idl-conformance/_qos/rust|cargo,zerodds-src|run|cargo run --quiet|ALL 9 QOS CHECKS VERIFIED|RELIABILITY, DURABILITY, HISTORY, DEADLINE, LIVELINESS, OWNERSHIP, PARTITION, a ContentFilteredTopic and the keyed instance lifecycle, each observed over two DCPS participants in the Rust binding.
