rmw-spatial-bridge|cargo,zerodds-src,python3,ros2-rmw-zerodds|run|bash run.sh|SPATIAL BRIDGE OK|The bridge runs inside rmw_zerodds_cpp in a ROS 2 node; run.sh starts that node and the SpatialDDS side for each direction and requires every pose written to arrive.

