# --- Native language frontends: idlc-typed samples through an endpoint SDK ---
native-frontends|cargo,go,zerodds-src|run|cd go && ./run.sh|OK: ping-pong (sync+async) + reliable|Fresh generated Go codec + shared wire runtime; sync, async and 12-sample loss recovery measured on 2026-09-12. Other SDK languages are not examples in this directory.
